---
---

<section class="how-it-works">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="section-header">
			<h2 class="section-title">Así de <span class="accent">simple</span></h2>
			<p class="section-subtitle">Tres pasos para tomar el control de tus finanzas</p>
		</div>
		
		<div class="steps-grid">
			<div class="step-card">
				<div class="step-number">01</div>
				<h3>Conecta tu cuenta</h3>
				<p>Permite acceso a las notificaciones bancarias para capturar transacciones automáticamente.</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="step-card">
				<div class="step-number">02</div>
				<h3>Déjalo trabajar</h3>
				<p>La app captura, categoriza y organiza todas tus transacciones sin que muevas un dedo.</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="step-card">
				<div class="step-number">03</div>
				<h3>Explora tus datos</h3>
				<p>Conversa con tu asistente de IA sobre tus gastos, ahorros y metas financieras.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.container {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 2rem;
	}

	.how-it-works {
		padding: 6rem 0;
	}

	.section-header {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto 4rem;
	}

	.section-title {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}

	.accent {
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.section-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		color: var(--color-gray);
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.steps-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.step-card {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		border-radius: 20px;
		padding: 2.5rem;
		position: relative;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.step-card:hover {
		background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05);
		border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
		transform: translateY(-4px);
	}

	.step-number {
		font-size: 3rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-accent) 0%, var(--color-accent-secondary) 100%);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
		background-clip: text;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		line-height: 1;
	}

	.step-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		color: white;
	}

	.step-card p {
		color: var(--color-gray);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	@media (max-width: 968px) {
		.how-it-works {
			padding: 4rem 0;
		}

		.section-title {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		.steps-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
